list of places to catch some good music in New Orleans. There was no cover but that evens out since they \"suggest\" you buy at least one drink every set. We saw the Swinging Gypsies play on a Friday night and they were great! I really enjoyed the music. It was heavily guitar jazz, so not as stereotypically \"New Orleans\" as the trumpet and trombone but still excellent. Our service was good, but definitely nothing above and beyond what's expected. We ordered the garlic fries (YUM) and I got a grapefruit Radler. My husband got another beer. It's neat they have an open kitchen so you can see what's going on. The venue definitely seems better for music and dri..."},{"business_id":"pUlpCJBYR7chLMMUKA5Ydg","review_id":"5CMgWo-dyUpTwJKhG54rTg","date":"2010-11-18T16:54:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9385863542556763,"text_excerpt":"On my last night in New Orleans, my friends and I found La Maison thanks to the phenomenal music that we could hear from across the street. Our mission that night was in fact to find a club with live jazz, not really so difficult to do in this town, obviously. What I really like about La Maison is that it's larger than the Spotted Cat down the street where you're really going to have to be OK with being on top of strangers that surround you (the music is so phenomenal there, though, you really don't care). We were able to grab a table, despite it being a pretty crowded night. Drinks were good and didn't seem overpriced considering that there was no cover to get in. But what we came for wa..."},{"business_id":"pUlpCJBYR7chLMMUKA5Ydg","review_id":"S3qow2aTUIrveK5W3IHL2g","date":"2019-07-09T01:24:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.937583327293396,"text_excerpt":"Really one of the better live music venues I've been to. Quite large and perfect for a band to set up near the door and explode throughout the bar. Drinks are definitely $1 or 2 more than they should be, but the acts seemed better quality than the rest of Frenchmen. Beer list fine but expect $7 each for a 12oz. Some NOLA classics available just not sure price. Tough to hear but multiple levels if you're looking for another act or just a quieter area. They got their shit together and with free cover I'd recommend to all."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"pUlpCJBYR7chLMMUKA5Ydg","photo_id":"6-vYEb8K6lfx6BlZmnFGfg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/6-vYEb8K6lfx6BlZmnFGfg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8775824904441833},{"business_id":"pUlpCJBYR7chLMMUKA5Ydg","photo_id":"Ab8nFwkNm7JuVmYOd73aiQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Ab8nFwkNm7JuVmYOd73aiQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8411537408828735},{"business_id":"pUlpCJBYR7chLMMUKA5Ydg","photo_id":"_g9xCHwvlxHzNa7gv8PoHA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/_g9xCHwvlxHzNa7gv8PoHA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8053749203681946},{"business_id":"pUlpCJBYR7chLMMUKA5Ydg","photo_id":"LDxPDK_o3bBH6FwL3OlCeg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/LDxPDK_o3bBH6FwL3OlCeg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7652881145477295},{"business_id":"pUlpCJBYR7chLMMUKA5Ydg","photo_id":"MJg3lILv4kWU_B6UXpqtLw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/MJg3lILv4kWU_B6UXpqtLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7202086448669434}]},"notebook_case":null}
